apers"],"from":"skill","tr":"ma'amarim"},{"he":"סטודנטים","en":"students","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"studentim"},{"he":"סטודנטית","en":"student (f)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"studentit"},{"he":"הוכיח","en":"proved","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hokhiakh"},{"he":"פורסם","en":"was published","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"pursam"},{"he":"הממצאים","en":"the findings","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hanimtza'im"},{"he":"אקדמי","en":"academic","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"akademi"},{"he":"מדעי","en":"scientific","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"mada'i"},{"he":"המחקר","en":"the research","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hamekhkar"},{"he":"הפרופסור","en":"the professor","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"haprofesor"},{"he":"הסטודנט","en":"the student","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hastudent"},{"he":"הניסוי","en":"the experiment","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hanisuy"}],"lexemes":["מחקר","המחקר","תואר","הרצאה","ההרצאה","מאמר","המאמר","מאמרים","ניסוי","הניסוי","תיאוריה","התיאוריה","פרופסור","הפרופסור","סטודנט","הסטודנט","סטודנטים","הסטודנטים","סטודנטית","הסטודנטית","הוכיח","הוכחה","פורסם","פרסם","הממצאים","אקדמי","האקדמי","מדעי","מרתקת","נכשל","כתבתי"],"tips":"## Academic and University Vocabulary\n\n### Degree Levels\n\n| Hebrew | English |\n|---|---|\n| תואר ראשון | Bachelor's degree (B.A.) |\n| תואר שני | Master's degree (M.A.) |\n| תואר שלישי / דוקטורט | Doctorate (Ph.D.) |\n\n### Academic Verbs\n\n| Verb | Meaning | Pattern |\n|---|---|---|\n| לפרסם | to publish | Pi'el |\n| להוכיח | to prove | Hif'il |\n| לחקור | to research | Pa'al |\n| להרצות | to lecture | Hif'il |\n\n### Passive Forms\n\nAcademic Hebrew frequently uses passive constructions:\n- פורסם — was published (Pu'al)\n- הוכחה — was proven (Huf'al)\n- הוגש — was submitted (Huf'al)\n\n### Common Academic Phrases\n- **כתב עת** — journal (literally \"writing of time\")\n- **עבודת מחקר** — research paper\n- **ממצאי המחקר** — research findings"}